{"seq":4,"slug":"scheduler","title":"调度器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/core-concepts/scheduler","wordCount":791,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"调度器\">调度器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Scheduler（调度器）是 React 的独立包 <code>scheduler</code>，负责决定哪些任务先执行、何时让出主线程、何时恢复被中断的任务，是并发模式的时间切片基础设施。它用两个最小堆分别维护延迟任务与就绪任务，用超时时间控制任务的紧迫程度以免低优先级任务饥饿，并借助 MessageChannel 触发宿主回调。本章讲解它的角色、任务优先级、队列实现、宿主回调选择与完整调度流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"scheduler-的角色\">Scheduler 的角色</h2><p>React 的 <strong>Scheduler（调度器）</strong> 是一个独立的包 <code>scheduler</code>，负责管理任务的优先级和执行时机。它决定哪些任务先执行、何时让出主线程、何时恢复被中断的任务。Scheduler 是 React 并发模式的基础设施。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[React 产生更新] --&gt; B[Scheduler 接收任务]&#10;    B --&gt; C[按优先级插入任务队列]&#10;    C --&gt; D{当前有更高优先级任务?}&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; E[中断当前任务]&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; F[继续执行当前任务]&#10;    E --&gt; G[执行高优先级任务]&#10;    G --&gt; H[恢复被中断的任务]&#10;    F --&gt; I{时间片用完?}&#10;    I -- 是 --&gt; J[让出主线程]&#10;    I -- 否 --&gt; F&#10;    J --&gt; K[下一帧恢复]&#10;    K --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[React 产生更新] --&gt; B[Scheduler 接收任务]\n    B --&gt; C[按优先级插入任务队列]\n    C --&gt; D{当前有更高优先级任务?}\n    D -- 是 --&gt; E[中断当前任务]\n    D -- 否 --&gt; F[继续执行当前任务]\n    E --&gt; G[执行高优先级任务]\n    G --&gt; H[恢复被中断的任务]\n    F --&gt; I{时间片用完?}\n    I -- 是 --&gt; J[让出主线程]\n    I -- 否 --&gt; F\n    J --&gt; K[下一帧恢复]\n    K --&gt; F</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"task-priority-任务优先级\">Task Priority 任务优先级</h2><p>Scheduler 定义了 5 个优先级级别，每个级别对应不同的超时时间。超时时间决定了任务等待多久后会被强制执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type PriorityLevel = 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5;&#10;&#10;const ImmediatePriority: PriorityLevel = 1;&#10;const UserBlockingPriority: PriorityLevel = 2;&#10;const NormalPriority: PriorityLevel = 3;&#10;const LowPriority: PriorityLevel = 4;&#10;const IdlePriority: PriorityLevel = 5;&#10;&#10;const IMMEDIATE_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT = -1;&#10;const USER_BLOCKING_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT = 250;&#10;const NORMAL_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT = 5000;&#10;const LOW_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT = 10000;&#10;const IDLE_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT = 1073741823; // ~12.4 天\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriorityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ImmediatePriority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriorityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UserBlockingPriority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriorityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NormalPriority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriorityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LowPriority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriorityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> IdlePriority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriorityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> IMMEDIATE_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> USER_BLOCKING_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 250</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NORMAL_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LOW_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> IDLE_PRIORITY_TIMEOUT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1073741823</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ~12.4 天</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>超时时间</th>\n<th>React 中的使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Immediate</td>\n<td>-1（立即过期）</td>\n<td><code>flushSync</code>、离散事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UserBlocking</td>\n<td>250ms</td>\n<td>连续输入事件（拖拽、滚动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Normal</td>\n<td>5000ms</td>\n<td>普通 <code>setState</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Low</td>\n<td>10000ms</td>\n<td><code>startTransition</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Idle</td>\n<td>~12.4 天</td>\n<td><code>useDeferredValue</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 超时时间不是任务的执行时长，而是任务从创建到被强制执行的最大等待时间。过期的任务优先级最高，会被立即执行以避免饥饿。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"任务队列实现\">任务队列实现</h2><p>Scheduler 维护两个队列，都使用<strong>最小堆（Min Heap）</strong> 实现，按照到期时间排序：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph timerQueue[timerQueue 延迟队列]&#10;        T1[&quot;任务A startTime=100&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;任务B startTime=200&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph taskQueue[taskQueue 就绪队列]&#10;        Q1[&quot;任务C expirationTime=50&quot;]&#10;        Q2[&quot;任务D expirationTime=80&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    timerQueue --&gt;|startTime 到达| taskQueue&#10;    taskQueue --&gt;|按 expirationTime 取出| E[执行任务]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph timerQueue[timerQueue 延迟队列]\n        T1[\"任务A startTime=100\"]\n        T2[\"任务B startTime=200\"]\n    end\n    subgraph taskQueue[taskQueue 就绪队列]\n        Q1[\"任务C expirationTime=50\"]\n        Q2[\"任务D expirationTime=80\"]\n    end\n\n    timerQueue --&gt;|startTime 到达| taskQueue\n    taskQueue --&gt;|按 expirationTime 取出| E[执行任务]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Task {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  callback: ((didTimeout: boolean) =&gt; void) | null;&#10;  priorityLevel: PriorityLevel;&#10;  startTime: number;&#10;  expirationTime: number;&#10;  sortIndex: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const taskQueue: Task[] = [];&#10;const timerQueue: Task[] = [];&#10;&#10;function scheduleCallback(&#10;  priorityLevel: PriorityLevel,&#10;  callback: (didTimeout: boolean) =&gt; void,&#10;  options?: { delay: number },&#10;): Task {&#10;  const currentTime = getCurrentTime();&#10;  const startTime = options?.delay ? currentTime + options.delay : currentTime;&#10;&#10;  const timeout = getTimeoutByPriority(priorityLevel);&#10;  const expirationTime = startTime + timeout;&#10;&#10;  const newTask: Task = {&#10;    id: taskIdCounter++,&#10;    callback,&#10;    priorityLevel,&#10;    startTime,&#10;    expirationTime,&#10;    sortIndex: -1,&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  if (startTime &gt; currentTime) {&#10;    newTask.sortIndex = startTime;&#10;    push(timerQueue, newTask);&#10;    advanceTimers(currentTime);&#10;  } else {&#10;    newTask.sortIndex = expirationTime;&#10;    push(taskQueue, newTask);&#10;    requestHostCallback();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return newTask;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  callback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">didTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priorityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PriorityLevel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  startTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expirationTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sortIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> taskQueue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> timerQueue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=<